# ==============================================================================
# MUNICIPAL SERVICE PORTAL - FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# For Vanilla JS / Static hosting, frontend runtime config is resolved in:
#   frontend/js/config.js (or via localStorage override in browser console)
#
# If migrating to Vite / CRA / Next.js bundlers in the future:
# - Vite:      VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
# - CRA:       REACT_APP_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
# - Next.js:   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
# ==============================================================================

# Active Backend REST API Endpoint (Render Web Service)
VITE_API_URL=https://municipal-service-portal-api.onrender.com
REACT_APP_API_URL=https://municipal-service-portal-api.onrender.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://municipal-service-portal-api.onrender.com
